    <footnotes>
        <footnote id="F1">The two reported transactions involved an amendment of an outstanding option, resulting in the deemed cancellation of the &quot;old&quot; option and the grant of a replacement option. The option was originally granted on November 5, 2025 and is partially vested.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F2">The transaction reported herein reflects a one-time stock option repricing (the &quot;Option Repricing&quot;) pursuant to which the exercise price of the reported option has been amended to reduce the exercise price to $7.63 per share.  If the Reporting Person exercises this option prior to the earliest of: (i) November 13, 2027; (ii) a Change in Control, as defined in the Issuer's 2025 Equity Incentive Plan (the &quot;2025 Plan&quot;); and (iii) the Reporting Person's death or Disability or termination of employment by the Issuer without Cause (each as defined in the 2025 Plan) or resignation following a Change in Control for Good Reason (as defined in the Reporting Person's employment agreement, if applicable), then the Reporting Person will be required to pay a premium exercise price equal to the original exercise price per share of such option.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F3">One fourth (1/4) of the shares subject to the option award vested on November 5, 2026 and the remaining shares subject to the option shall vest in thirty-six (36) equal monthly installments thereafter, subject to the Reporting Person's continuous service through such vesting date.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F4">The two reported transactions involved an amendment of an outstanding option, resulting in the deemed cancellation of the &quot;old&quot; option and the grant of a replacement option. The option was originally granted on April 16, 2026.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F5">One fourth (1/4) of the shares subject to the option award shall vest on April 16, 2027 and the remaining shares subject to the option shall vest in thirty-six (36) equal monthly installments thereafter, subject to the Reporting Person's continuous service through such vesting date.</footnote>
